{"id":"avariya","lemma":"авария","pos":"noun","rank":2352,"glosses":["damage, breakdown, fault, failure, crash (rarely)","accident, crash, wreck, emergency (situation caused by damage, breakdown or failure)","misfortune"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b2/Ru-%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"аварии","plural":"аварии"},"examples":[{"text":"Что ты знаешь об аварии?","en":"What do you know about the accident?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"about"},null]},{"text":"Я слышал об аварии.","en":"I heard about the accident.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"},{"g":"about"},null]},{"text":"Где случилась эта авария?","en":"Where did the accident happen?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"},null,null]},{"text":"Том погиб в той аварии?","en":"Did Tom die in that accident?","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to perish","l":"погибнуть"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null]},{"text":"Я не видел аварии.","en":"I didn't see the accident.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},null]}]}